length push
-----
_ do _[
    _any set _ import .value.any,
    _get_length set _ import .text.get_length,
    _push set _ import .text.push,
    _t set _ any .text,
    _l set _t which get_length : .,
    _t which push : "a",
    _l1 set _t which get_length : .,
    l1 == l + 1
]
-----
true
